        "# Machine Learning - Assignment 2\n",
        "\n",
        "### **Preparation:**\n",
        "- __محمد حسام الدين محمد محمد - 23011471__ \n",
        "- __محمد ياسر محمد سليمان النفراوي - 23011507__\n",
        "- __محمد أيمن السيد أحمد حامد - 23011465__\n",
        "\n",
        "**This project uses the Titanic dataset to build a machine learning model that predicts whether a passenger survived or not using the K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) algorithm. The workflow includes data cleaning, feature encoding, data splitting, model tuning to find the best K value, and evaluation using accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, and cross-validation. A confusion matrix heatmap is used for visual performance analysis.**"
      ]
    }
   ]
}

